T59	Entity 7238 7241	she
T60	Cue 7242 7246	said
T61	Quotation 7248 7568	"for it made me angry to see the easy way in which Mr. Windibank-- that is, my father-- took it all. He would not go to the police, and he would not go to you, and so at last, as he would do nothing and kept on saying that there was no harm done, it made me mad, and I just on with my things and came right away to you."
